+| `|A|` | 32 |
+| independent planted instances | 8 |
+| random permutations per instance | 25,000 |
+| valid guesses | **200,000 / 200,000** |
+| measured `P(random guess)` | **1.0** |
+| required by G4 | `< 1e-6` |
